{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8f3c1d20-5b7a-4d4e-9c11-kaspi001",
    "name": "Kaspi POS Simulator",
    "description": "Kaspi POS 终端模拟器调试集合。\n\n启动建议（Postman 调试用）：\n  python kaspi_pos_simulator.py --http --port 8080\n  python kaspi_pos_simulator.py --http --fast --port 8080   # 时序压缩到 ~1 秒，快速跑完整流程\n  python kaspi_pos_simulator.py --http --secure --port 8080 # 需要 accesstoken 头\n\n注意：\n1. 模拟器默认 HTTPS + 自签证书。用 --http 可省去证书校验；若坚持 HTTPS，请在 Postman\n   Settings → General 关闭 \"SSL certificate verification\"。\n2. /v2/status 必须带 terminalid 头（手册 3.18），默认终端号 31452963。\n3. 状态按真实时间推进：发起支付后等约 6 秒（--fast 约 1 秒）再点 status，\n   或连点几次 Send 观察 Initialize → WaitUser → WaitForQrConfirmation → QrTransactionSuccess。\n4. 退款必须先有一笔成功支付：transactionId 由 status 响应自动写入集合变量。\n5. 同一时刻只允许一笔未完成交易，卡住时用「reset - 清空全部交易」。\n6. 业务结果一律看 body 的 statusCode，HTTP 码只表示协议层（400 参数 / 401 鉴权 / 403 令牌过期 / 404 路径）。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8080" },
    { "key": "terminalId", "value": "31452963" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "processId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "transactionId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "amount", "value": "1000" }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// 统一打印业务码，避免只看 HTTP 码被误导",
          "try {",
          "    const b = pm.response.json();",
          "    const biz = b.statusCode;",
          "    const label = biz === 0 ? 'OK' : 'BIZ-' + biz;",
          "    console.log(pm.info.requestName + ' -> HTTP ' + pm.response.code + ' | ' + label + (b.errorText ? ' | ' + b.errorText : ''));",
          "    pm.test('response has statusCode field', () => pm.expect(b).to.have.property('statusCode'));",
          "} catch (e) {",
          "    console.log(pm.info.requestName + ' -> HTTP ' + pm.response.code + ' (non-JSON body)');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
